Consider the following C code segment. Calculate the total number of processes created, the number of child processes created, and how many times 'SSC-JE' will be printed:

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <unistd.h>
int main() {
    fork();
    fork();
    fork();
    printf("SSC-JE\n");
    return 0;
}
```
